All national highways shall vest in the Union, and for the purposes of this Act "Highways" include-- (i) all lands appurtenant thereto, whether demarcated or not;
(ii) all bridges, culverts, tunnels, causeways, carriageways and other structures constructed or across such highways; and (iii) all fences, trees, posts and boundary, furlong and mile stones of such highways or any land appurtenant to such highways.
